{"document_id": 108, "sha256": "4ba019cef71a218b247b3d5ada872cfc751805546e623d4dcc1980fda1122767", "agency": "fda", "doc_type": "approval_letter", "program_id": "stelara", "engine": "prep-1.4+docling2.137.0+tables-accurate+repair1+pictables1", "watermarks_removed": 0, "routes": [{"page": 1, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2015"}, {"page": 2, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2362"}, {"page": 3, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1493"}, {"page": 4, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=534"}], "blocks": [{"type": "picture", "ref": "#/pictures/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [71.3, 720.1, 264.1, 756.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "caption": "", "text": "", "status": "kept", "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 658.1, 180.2, 682.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 125261 / S-166 BLA 761044 / S-014", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/1", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 561.5, 309.4, 627.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc. Attention: Matthew Phillips, PhD, RAC Associate Director, Global Regulatory Affairs Welsh & McKean Roads, PO Box 776 Spring House, PA 19477", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/2", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 520.1, 162.0, 530.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Dr. Phillips:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/3", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 464.9, 519.8, 503.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your supplemental biologics license applications (sBLAs), dated and received April 3, 2024, and your amendments, submitted under section 351(a) of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara (ustekinumab) injection.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 382.1, 529.0, 448.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "These Prior Approval supplemental biologics applications provide for revisions to the Prescribing Information in the DRUG INTERACTIONS, CYP450 Substrates and CLINCIAL PHARMACOLOGY, Pharmacokinetics subsections based on results from a drug interaction study with CYP450 substrates in subjects with Crohn's disease conducted as a postmarketing commitment (PMC 3112-4).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 354.5, 215.3, 365.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "APPROVAL & LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 299.3, 537.0, 337.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this application, as amended. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed agreed-upon labeling with minor editorial revisions listed below and reflected in the enclosed labeling:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [93.2, 257.1, 534.1, 281.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "Updated the revision date at the end of Highlights of the Prescribing Information to the approval month", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [93.2, 228.7, 500.1, 253.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "Corrected the revision date in the Medication Guide to the date of the last approved revision (03/2024)", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 201.1, 214.7, 211.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 104.5, 532.7, 184.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at FDA.gov, 1 that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the Prescribing Information, Medication Guide and Instructions for Use) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 72.3, 456.9, 82.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "1 http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.0, 644.3, 540.1, 655.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5479362", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 742.7, 180.2, 753.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261 / S-166", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 728.9, 180.2, 739.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761044 / S-014", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 715.1, 110.0, 725.9], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 664.5, 502.8, 689.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As. 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 636.9, 440.9, 647.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 512.7, 538.9, 620.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that include labeling changes for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in Microsoft Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application, as well as annual reportable changes. To facilitate review of your submission(s), provide a highlighted or marked-up copy that shows all changes, as well as a clean Microsoft Word version. The marked-up copy should provide appropriate annotations, including supplement number(s) and annual report date(s).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 485.1, 369.2, 495.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 443.7, 521.0, 468.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have received your submission dated April 3, 2024, containing the final report for the following postmarketing commitment listed in our approval letter for BLA 761044.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [90.0, 374.7, 530.7, 426.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "3112-4 Conduct a clinical trial to assess whether STELARA (ustekinumab) alters the metabolism or pharmacokinetics of cytochrome P450 (CYP) substrates in Crohn's disease (CD) patients treated with ustekinumab (e.g., using a cocktail of relevant CYP probe drugs).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [144.0, 319.5, 331.4, 357.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Final Protocol Submission: 03/2017 Trial Completion: 09/2019 Final Report Submission: 03/2020", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 278.1, 508.2, 302.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have reviewed your submission and conclude that the above commitment was fulfilled.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 236.7, 494.3, 261.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that there are postmarketing requirement and postmarketing commitment listed in the September 23, 2016, approval letter that are still open.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 209.1, 235.3, 219.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 153.9, 522.1, 192.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You may request advisory comments on proposed introductory advertising and promotional labeling. For information about submitting promotional materials, see the final guidance for industry Providing Regulatory Submissions in Electronic and Non-", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 83.9, 534.7, 93.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "2 We update guidances periodically. For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA Guidance", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/29", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 72.3, 465.1, 81.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Documents Database https://www.fda.gov/RegulatoryInformation/Guidances/default.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/30", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 59.3, 238.7, 68.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "U.S. Food and Drug Administration", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/31", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 36.3, 133.7, 45.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "www.fda.gov", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/32", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 47.9, 180.4, 56.9], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Silver Spring, MD 20993", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/33", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5479362", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/34", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 742.7, 180.2, 753.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261 / S-166", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/35", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 728.9, 180.2, 739.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761044 / S-014", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/36", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 715.1, 110.0, 725.9], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/37", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 664.5, 480.1, 689.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "Electronic Format-Promotional Labeling and Advertising Materials for Human Prescription Drugs. 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["Electronic Format-Promotional Labeling and Advertising Materials for Human Prescription Drugs. 3"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/38", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 595.5, 532.7, 647.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You must submit final promotional materials and Prescribing Information, accompanied by a Form FDA 2253, at the time of initial dissemination or publication [21 CFR 314.81(b)(3)(i)]. Form FDA 2253 is available at FDA.gov. 4 Information and Instructions for completing the form can be found at FDA.gov. 5", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["Electronic Format-Promotional Labeling and Advertising Materials for Human Prescription Drugs. 3"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/39", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 567.9, 243.3, 578.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/40", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 526.5, 531.5, 551.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/41", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 485.1, 517.4, 509.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, contact Jay Fajiculay, PharmD, Senior Regulatory Health Project Manager, at (301) 796-9007 or email at jay.fajiculay@fda.hhs.gov.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/42", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.0, 457.5, 331.7, 468.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_l